        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.585,
            0.902,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " In   PQR, right-angled at Q, PR + QR = 25 cm and PQ = 5 cm. Determine the values of sin P, cos P and tan P."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.632,
            0.721,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " State whether the following are true or false. Justify your answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.655,
            0.561,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) The value of tan A is always less than 1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.675,
            0.548,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) sec "
