          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.714,
            0.719,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) cos A is the abbreviation used for the cosecant of angle A."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.737,
            0.503,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) cot A is the product of cot and A."
