          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8.3 Trigonometric Ratios of Some Specific Angles"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.84,
            0.902,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "From geometry, you are already familiar with the construction of angles of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 45°, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . In this section, we will find the values of the trigonometric ratios for these angles and, of course, for "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        }
